WEBVTT

01:40.800 --> 01:45.830
[Love in Pavilion]

01:46.330 --> 01:50.720
[Episode 13]

01:57.460 --> 01:58.820
Head south?

02:01.320 --> 02:02.980
Head south for fifteen miles,

02:03.120 --> 02:05.320
then cross three mountains to the west.

02:06.600 --> 02:07.400
That's right.

02:07.710 --> 02:08.940
Head south for fifteen miles,

02:08.940 --> 02:11.140
then cross three mountains to the west.

02:21.310 --> 02:22.910
Head west for fifteen miles,

02:23.050 --> 02:25.310
then cross three mountains to the south.

02:53.280 --> 02:54.990
The dreams of the Clairvoyant Eye

02:54.990 --> 02:56.320
are all real.

02:59.190 --> 03:00.920
What exactly did he go through?

03:01.560 --> 03:04.020
Why did he gouge out his own Clairvoyant Eye?

03:05.700 --> 03:07.280
Sky City is where humans and demons gather,

03:07.280 --> 03:08.960
and information travels fastest there.

03:08.960 --> 03:11.240
Maybe I can find the information I need there.

03:11.240 --> 03:12.250
No matter what,

03:13.630 --> 03:14.960
I must find him.

04:06.050 --> 04:07.440
Wangquan Hongye.

04:11.310 --> 04:15.120
You said Lord Jiuhuo erased my memories

04:15.140 --> 04:16.329
and lied to me.

04:16.430 --> 04:18.390
But Lord Jiuhuo said

04:18.680 --> 04:21.000
you're coveting my demonic energy.

04:21.880 --> 04:24.690
One of you must be lying.

04:36.310 --> 04:37.120
So it's true—

04:37.670 --> 04:41.190
absorbing Jia Lan's demonic energy can break the spell.

04:47.500 --> 04:49.120
It looks quite pretty.

04:55.680 --> 04:56.950
I told you

04:58.070 --> 04:59.920
that you would come to save me.

05:03.130 --> 05:04.550
Save me,

05:06.290 --> 05:07.450
and I can...

05:08.800 --> 05:10.070
help you deal with...

05:12.070 --> 05:13.410
Jiuhuo.

05:13.830 --> 05:16.800
Did I ever say I wanted to deal with Lord Jiuhuo?

05:20.560 --> 05:22.600
Is he truly good to you,

05:23.830 --> 05:25.630
or is he just treating you

05:26.400 --> 05:27.910
as Jia Lan's replacement?

05:29.270 --> 05:31.730
Why does the mandala flower on your forehead

05:31.750 --> 05:34.350
look exactly like Jia Lan's?

05:36.720 --> 05:38.390
You're just a prisoner,

05:39.600 --> 05:41.020
and you dare to sow discord

05:41.020 --> 05:43.840
between me and Lord Jiuhuo?

05:45.890 --> 05:46.950
I know

05:47.880 --> 05:49.180
what he wants

05:50.220 --> 05:51.740
isn't just a replacement.

05:52.860 --> 05:53.940
He wants

05:54.560 --> 05:56.000
the real Jia Lan.

05:59.190 --> 06:00.900
I am who I am,

06:01.290 --> 06:03.300
not anyone's replacement.

06:04.690 --> 06:05.450
Well...

06:07.560 --> 06:08.690
then...

06:10.770 --> 06:12.200
prove it to me.

06:23.240 --> 06:25.500
Why is it getting more and more desolate?

06:25.720 --> 06:26.820
Could it be...

06:27.950 --> 06:31.750
Could it be that I remembered the route the girl gave me incorrectly?

06:34.920 --> 06:36.120
I'm so stupid.

06:37.550 --> 06:38.700
I'm so hungry.

06:47.030 --> 06:48.060
There's hope.

06:48.090 --> 06:49.159
There's hope.

06:58.740 --> 07:00.350
I am who I am,

07:00.720 --> 07:02.560
not anyone's replacement.

07:03.510 --> 07:07.000
Then prove it to me.

07:13.360 --> 07:14.390
Servants.

07:16.360 --> 07:17.510
Left Guardian.

07:18.610 --> 07:20.750
Is Lord Jiuhuo in his chamber?

07:20.800 --> 07:21.720
Left Guardian,

07:21.870 --> 07:23.530
Lord Jiuhuo has left the city.

07:25.830 --> 07:27.680
I see. You may go.

07:28.560 --> 07:29.390
Yes.

08:19.800 --> 08:22.520
They used the entire Netherworld Clan to threaten me,

08:22.520 --> 08:24.060
forcing me to comply,

08:24.680 --> 08:26.090
to go alone to meet them

08:26.120 --> 08:28.640
at the Beast Kingdom's dungeon.

08:29.950 --> 08:31.430
Beast Kingdom?

08:51.840 --> 08:53.780
[Strange Tales in Beast Kingdom]

08:57.390 --> 08:59.560
The Black Fox destroyed the world,

08:59.580 --> 09:01.440
drawing a circle as the boundary.

09:02.640 --> 09:04.940
Everything I am doing now

09:04.960 --> 09:07.140
is to bring Jia Lan back.

09:07.440 --> 09:08.930
Jia Lan is still alive?

09:09.290 --> 09:10.220
Of course.

09:11.010 --> 09:12.920
But she's blocked outside the Boundary

09:12.920 --> 09:14.620
and can't come in.

09:14.920 --> 09:18.490
The Black Fox beyond the Boundary is Jia Lan.

09:21.690 --> 09:24.500
The Black Fox feeds on hatred.

09:25.160 --> 09:26.820
Its demonic power is immense.

09:27.880 --> 09:29.710
It can control people's minds

09:29.820 --> 09:31.730
and has no physical form.

09:33.000 --> 09:35.160
No physical form?

09:38.390 --> 09:40.060
Beyond the Boundary,

09:40.560 --> 09:43.250
alive, yet without a body.

09:43.590 --> 09:44.780
So it's you.

09:46.020 --> 09:48.820
Good. I'm very satisfied.

09:51.760 --> 09:53.050
No wonder

09:54.360 --> 09:56.120
you said I'm good.

09:57.390 --> 09:59.880
Aren't I the new body

09:59.960 --> 10:02.020
that Lord Jiuhuo carefully prepared

10:02.570 --> 10:04.260
for you?

10:25.050 --> 10:27.710
Lord Jiuhuo, such fine wine,

10:27.740 --> 10:29.240
wouldn't it be better to share it with me

10:29.240 --> 10:30.120
rather than

10:30.600 --> 10:32.040
enjoying it alone?

10:45.120 --> 10:47.750
Lord Jiuhuo, you look quite troubled.

10:50.380 --> 10:51.790
A leech demon

10:51.790 --> 10:53.320
that is very important to me

10:53.970 --> 10:55.030
escaped.

10:55.360 --> 10:57.620
But I've already sent Ye Yuan to find her.

10:58.840 --> 10:59.790
My Lord,

11:01.000 --> 11:02.860
once the Golden Dawn is repaired,

11:03.320 --> 11:05.050
you will be able to save Jia Lan.

11:05.790 --> 11:07.000
When that time comes,

11:07.750 --> 11:10.030
will I fall out of your favor?

11:16.440 --> 11:19.030
It seems I indeed will.

11:20.130 --> 11:21.400
As compensation,

11:21.910 --> 11:24.600
I'll just take this pot of wine.

11:41.610 --> 11:44.180
Slow down, slow down.

11:45.620 --> 11:47.150
You look weary from travel.

11:47.630 --> 11:49.430
You must have come from far away.

11:50.000 --> 11:51.630
Where are you heading?

11:52.820 --> 11:54.420
I'm going to Golden Dawn Inn.

11:54.790 --> 11:56.550
This is Baiyu Village.

11:56.600 --> 11:59.400
The Golden Dawn Inn is not far outside the village.

12:01.720 --> 12:03.150
Looks like that leech demon girl

12:03.150 --> 12:04.480
really didn't lie to me.

12:07.210 --> 12:08.460
What did you say?

12:08.480 --> 12:10.210
You met that leech demon?

12:12.110 --> 12:13.170
Where is she?

12:13.390 --> 12:14.550
Where is she?

12:15.590 --> 12:17.960
Let... let me think.

12:18.200 --> 12:19.460
First, she was east...

12:19.490 --> 12:21.510
No, it should be the opposite.

12:25.510 --> 12:28.640
Chief, I can't quite remember.

12:52.270 --> 12:53.240
Does it hurt?

12:55.800 --> 12:57.010
Feeling upset?

13:00.300 --> 13:01.660
You met Jiuhuo?

13:02.460 --> 13:03.780
How did it go?

13:04.490 --> 13:06.440
I'm in a very bad mood right now.

13:07.000 --> 13:08.150
Don't provoke me.

13:10.930 --> 13:13.920
Are you laughing at me because I really did

13:14.440 --> 13:16.170
come back to you just as you predicted?

13:16.170 --> 13:17.550
I'm laughing

13:18.960 --> 13:20.690
because I won't die soon.

13:24.170 --> 13:27.600
Forsaking emotions, pursuing hatred; eternal night befalls.

13:27.600 --> 13:29.530
This "Eternal Night" refers to...

13:30.320 --> 13:31.390
Jia Lan.

13:33.510 --> 13:35.120
The Eternal Night is Jia Lan?

13:35.800 --> 13:37.840
Jiuhuo wants to erase everything about you

13:37.840 --> 13:39.260
and turn you into the Black Fox.

13:39.260 --> 13:40.790
Can you still laugh now?

13:43.200 --> 13:44.440
I can help you.

13:55.000 --> 13:56.120
Sure.

14:00.440 --> 14:03.000
This spiritual power has locked your heart meridian.

14:03.000 --> 14:04.780
If you don't listen to me,

14:04.870 --> 14:08.270
I can make you suffer with just a flick of my finger.

14:08.390 --> 14:11.360
You still refuse to believe me.

14:12.670 --> 14:15.630
My enemies are Jiuhuo and the Black Fox.

14:16.910 --> 14:18.480
You're just a human.

14:19.430 --> 14:21.270
What can you possibly change?

14:25.050 --> 14:27.760
[Baiyu Village]

14:26.570 --> 14:28.360
We've found traces of the leech demon?

14:28.360 --> 14:30.000
That young hero said he can't remember clearly.

14:30.000 --> 14:33.390
Chief, don't be too sad. Please accept our condolences.

14:33.390 --> 14:34.440
Yes, yes, Chief.

14:34.440 --> 14:34.960
Yes.

14:34.960 --> 14:37.150
Stop being sad, Dad. We'll keep searching.

14:37.150 --> 14:39.210
We'll definitely avenge my brother.

14:41.110 --> 14:43.660
Young hero, please don't take offense.

14:43.980 --> 14:45.910
The leech demon killed my brother.

14:46.570 --> 14:47.170
My father

14:48.060 --> 14:49.860
just wants to avenge my brother.

14:52.020 --> 14:55.300
But... she didn't seem like an evil demon at all.

14:55.660 --> 14:56.780
She even...

14:57.280 --> 14:59.440
kindly showed me the way.

14:59.670 --> 15:01.600
Demons are all deceitful by nature.

15:01.600 --> 15:03.670
They often use their appearance to deceive people.

15:03.670 --> 15:04.440
Chief!

15:04.870 --> 15:06.320
Chief, Chief!

15:06.460 --> 15:07.240
Sun,

15:07.270 --> 15:10.000
We've found the whereabouts of that leech demon.

15:10.080 --> 15:10.950
Young hero,

15:11.270 --> 15:12.240
that demon is very powerful

15:12.240 --> 15:13.200
and has killed so many people.

15:13.200 --> 15:14.150
Since you're here,

15:14.150 --> 15:15.610
why don't you come with us?

15:28.280 --> 15:29.860
It should be around here.

15:31.270 --> 15:32.270
Let me take a look.

15:45.200 --> 15:47.460
There's some movement deep in the woods.

15:48.300 --> 15:49.650
Alright.

15:56.600 --> 15:57.390
Sun,

15:58.270 --> 15:59.080
what's this?

15:59.360 --> 16:00.830
It's a wounded cat demon.

16:00.950 --> 16:02.150
It's perfect as bait.

16:03.360 --> 16:06.280
Come on, hide, hurry!

16:08.860 --> 16:09.760
Let's hide here.

16:09.760 --> 16:11.420
What you're doing is too much.

16:13.080 --> 16:14.150
Too much?

16:14.270 --> 16:15.510
They are demons.

16:15.590 --> 16:18.600
If we don't do this, how are we going to lure the leech demon out?

16:18.600 --> 16:19.870
Once we catch the leech demon,

16:19.870 --> 16:21.410
we'll go together to Sky City and claim the reward.

16:21.410 --> 16:22.220
By then,

16:22.240 --> 16:24.300
let's split the bounty fifty-fifty.

16:39.270 --> 16:40.360
It really is her.

16:56.870 --> 16:58.380
She's saving that demon.

17:09.400 --> 17:10.200
Look.

17:17.280 --> 17:18.690
What are you doing?

17:20.700 --> 17:22.560
Watch out for the poisonous mist!

17:33.420 --> 17:35.710
You bitch, what are you waiting for?

17:35.740 --> 17:36.890
Do it!

17:45.310 --> 17:47.690
Mu, ask her for the antidote.

17:48.070 --> 17:48.750
Hurry!

17:48.920 --> 17:49.510
Miss,

17:50.220 --> 17:51.790
if I'm not mistaken,

17:51.870 --> 17:54.110
you just used a paralytic poison,

17:54.370 --> 17:55.830
which isn't fatal, right?

18:03.240 --> 18:05.430
You demon, how dare you trick me!

18:08.200 --> 18:09.160
What are you doing?

18:09.160 --> 18:10.830
She... she's a demon!

18:11.070 --> 18:13.160
Whatever we do to her, it won't be too much!

18:13.160 --> 18:15.750
Don't forget, you're here to catch a demon.

18:17.720 --> 18:19.070
I am,

18:19.880 --> 18:22.480
but I can't kill innocents indiscriminately.

18:25.920 --> 18:27.350
We must

18:28.310 --> 18:29.960
get to the truth.

18:31.540 --> 18:33.100
Why did he save me?

18:37.040 --> 18:41.530
[Baiyu Village]

18:38.400 --> 18:39.200
Chief!

18:39.350 --> 18:41.680
Chief! We've caught the demon.

18:41.790 --> 18:43.180
We've caught the demon?

18:49.310 --> 18:50.850
We finally caught you.

18:50.870 --> 18:52.000
I'm going to kill you

18:52.000 --> 18:53.380
to avenge my son!

18:53.440 --> 18:55.960
Kill her! Kill her! Kill her!

18:56.000 --> 18:57.160
Everyone, please calm down!

18:57.160 --> 18:57.720
Kill her!

18:57.720 --> 18:58.640
Chief,

18:59.000 --> 19:00.830
let me ask her about the truth first.

19:00.830 --> 19:02.490
What's there to ask about?

19:06.740 --> 19:07.560
Miss,

19:07.920 --> 19:09.820
why did you kill the chief's son?

19:09.960 --> 19:11.640
Are you asking a demon

19:11.790 --> 19:13.270
why it kills?

19:13.290 --> 19:14.420
A demon is a demon.

19:14.450 --> 19:16.920
My son's death is the best evidence!

19:16.960 --> 19:18.360
What more is there to ask?

19:18.360 --> 19:20.040
Yeah, what more is there to ask?

19:20.040 --> 19:21.720
We shouldn't keep her alive.

19:21.880 --> 19:22.820
Kill her!

19:24.370 --> 19:25.570
Kill her!

19:25.830 --> 19:26.790
I'll kill you

19:26.880 --> 19:28.780
to avenge my son!

19:29.100 --> 19:30.940
I'll kill you!

19:32.140 --> 19:32.920
What?

19:48.810 --> 19:49.910
Dad, Dad.

19:50.290 --> 19:51.820
We can't let it escalate.

19:51.860 --> 19:53.160
If this guy gets angry

19:53.160 --> 19:54.260
and teams up with this demon,

19:54.260 --> 19:56.050
we'll be in big trouble.

19:59.140 --> 20:02.150
Mu, I know you have a kind heart.

20:02.750 --> 20:04.380
So, let's do as you said

20:04.400 --> 20:06.640
and wait for this demon to confess her crimes

20:06.640 --> 20:08.360
before we deal with her.

20:09.820 --> 20:11.100
Thank you, Sun.

20:11.440 --> 20:12.440
Thank you, Chief.

20:14.420 --> 20:15.830
What a dummy.

20:15.930 --> 20:17.410
You believe everyone.

20:35.060 --> 20:36.070
Miss, when you get angry,

20:36.070 --> 20:37.400
your eyes turn red.

20:37.880 --> 20:38.810
It's quite rare.

20:47.510 --> 20:48.570
What are you doing?

20:49.290 --> 20:50.860
I'm going to untie you.

20:51.190 --> 20:53.110
Because I don't think you're a bad demon.

20:53.110 --> 20:54.590
Such a hypocritical act.

20:54.590 --> 20:55.640
So annoying.

20:55.960 --> 20:57.490
Blue Eyes, you take charge.

21:16.640 --> 21:18.040
They've turned blue now.

21:20.270 --> 21:22.070
Miss, are you not angry anymore?

21:24.660 --> 21:26.150
I lied to you.

21:26.920 --> 21:28.790
I deliberately gave you wrong directions.

21:28.790 --> 21:30.960
I didn't expect you to still come here.

21:31.400 --> 21:32.510
However,

21:32.700 --> 21:35.070
this Baiyu Village is really not a good place.

21:35.070 --> 21:37.130
You should leave as soon as possible.

21:39.480 --> 21:40.960
Then can you tell me,

21:42.590 --> 21:44.590
did you really kill the chief's son?

21:46.640 --> 21:47.590
I...

21:49.400 --> 21:50.420
Mu.

21:51.780 --> 21:52.980
I brought you some...

21:53.790 --> 21:55.220
Why was she untied?

21:55.960 --> 21:57.750
Sun, with me here,

21:57.750 --> 21:58.750
she won't escape.

22:03.400 --> 22:04.590
Thank you, Mu.

22:04.790 --> 22:06.000
Then have this porridge first

22:06.000 --> 22:07.270
before you keep interrogating her.

22:07.270 --> 22:08.400
Thank you, Sun.

22:24.880 --> 22:26.310
Miss, have some porridge first.

22:26.310 --> 22:27.970
We'll talk after you're full.

22:28.270 --> 22:29.110
It's for me?

22:29.270 --> 22:30.790
Yes, aren't you hungry?

22:32.430 --> 22:34.570
He can't even tell that it was poisoned.

22:34.570 --> 22:36.050
What a dummy.

22:36.720 --> 22:37.580
I'm not hungry.

22:42.310 --> 22:43.640
Well, since you're not hungry,

22:43.640 --> 22:44.640
I'll have it.

22:44.790 --> 22:47.340
I'll bring you some food later.

22:48.960 --> 22:51.020
He won't turn back until he hits the wall.

22:51.020 --> 22:53.460
I might as well let him see for himself

22:53.480 --> 22:55.280
the true nature of these people.

23:08.740 --> 23:09.920
What's happening?

23:10.430 --> 23:12.260
I suddenly feel weak all over.

23:12.750 --> 23:13.940
Could it be...

23:14.790 --> 23:16.680
Could it be... food poisoning?

23:16.700 --> 23:18.620
Sir, you've been poisoned.

23:18.680 --> 23:19.900
Poisoned!

23:20.000 --> 23:20.960
I'm new here,

23:20.960 --> 23:22.160
with no grudges or enmity.

23:22.160 --> 23:23.560
Who would want to harm me?

23:24.680 --> 23:27.200
Never mind. I'll take you away from here first.

23:27.200 --> 23:29.020
It's late at night.

23:29.240 --> 23:30.970
Where are you going, handsome?

23:33.680 --> 23:35.330
This little demoness

23:35.510 --> 23:38.510
looks plain. She's really boring.

23:39.400 --> 23:40.440
Handsome,

23:40.590 --> 23:43.200
why don't you consider me instead?

23:43.790 --> 23:45.110
What are you trying to do?

23:45.110 --> 23:45.930
Blue Eyes,

23:45.950 --> 23:47.680
you don't have the guts to do this.

23:47.680 --> 23:48.610
Let me handle it.

23:50.460 --> 23:52.750
How considerate.

23:53.070 --> 23:54.620
Well, in that case,

23:54.830 --> 23:56.570
I'll give you a chance.

24:08.880 --> 24:12.330
I helped you heal before,

24:12.440 --> 24:14.300
but you attacked me in return.

24:14.370 --> 24:17.790
Now you dare to say I look plain?

24:18.200 --> 24:18.950
Miss.

24:20.590 --> 24:22.250
Let's leave this place first.

24:25.750 --> 24:26.310
Let's go!

24:39.920 --> 24:40.590
Miss!

24:45.640 --> 24:46.620
Dummy!

24:47.130 --> 24:49.510
You escaped my arrow in the forest last time.

24:49.510 --> 24:51.640
This time, neither of you will escape.

24:54.000 --> 24:54.830
Chief,

24:55.430 --> 24:56.710
why?

24:56.920 --> 24:59.400
You're sheltering the demon who killed my son.

24:59.400 --> 25:00.460
You deserve to die!

25:00.640 --> 25:02.950
None of you will escape today.

25:03.130 --> 25:05.060
The demon-controlling talisman!

25:05.510 --> 25:06.510
What are you waiting for?

25:06.510 --> 25:07.860
Kill them!

25:08.070 --> 25:08.930
Take my poison!

25:50.940 --> 25:51.930
How is it?

25:53.880 --> 25:56.310
My room isn't bad, right?

25:59.600 --> 26:00.830
If you hadn't said it,

26:01.440 --> 26:03.200
I'd think it was Jia Lan's.

26:03.310 --> 26:06.790
You know the consequences of angering me.

26:09.920 --> 26:11.180
It's quite miserable.

26:12.270 --> 26:13.110
Come here.

26:26.440 --> 26:27.110
Sit.

26:46.000 --> 26:47.000
I can do it myself.

26:48.920 --> 26:50.940
If you continue to act like this,

26:51.030 --> 26:53.880
it's hard for me to believe you can help me.

27:50.160 --> 27:53.560
You're willing to sacrifice your life for Dongfang Huaizhu.

27:55.130 --> 27:56.530
This feeling

27:56.590 --> 27:58.620
is just what I need

27:59.160 --> 28:01.490
to use against Lord Jiuhuo.

28:38.400 --> 28:40.150
Your breathing

28:40.840 --> 28:42.160
is quite rapid.

28:52.440 --> 28:53.550
What is this?

28:55.110 --> 28:56.960
This is the aphrodisiac incense

28:57.240 --> 28:58.900
I specially prepared for you.

29:00.000 --> 29:01.270
For me?

29:01.880 --> 29:02.920
You like it?

29:08.680 --> 29:11.920
Your face is so flushed.

29:14.420 --> 29:16.100
Are you feeling unwell?

29:20.930 --> 29:22.560
Or are you just shy?

29:33.520 --> 29:35.640
Are you feeling better now?

30:17.710 --> 30:18.770
I can't do this.

30:19.970 --> 30:21.590
This isn't what you want.

30:21.920 --> 30:23.330
Then what do I want?

30:25.000 --> 30:25.860
You want...

30:28.320 --> 30:29.610
You want...

30:30.910 --> 30:33.590
to know what Jiuhuo will do to you

30:33.610 --> 30:34.450
and...

30:35.400 --> 30:37.270
who would risk their life

30:39.600 --> 30:41.000
to help you deal with him.

30:43.880 --> 30:45.350
Are you saying...

30:46.110 --> 30:47.750
that person is you?

30:48.750 --> 30:52.010
I'm the only one who can help you.

31:00.600 --> 31:03.060
Then why don't you continue?

31:04.070 --> 31:04.930
Because...

31:06.160 --> 31:07.950
Because you're toying with me.

31:13.600 --> 31:15.600
If you can hold back

31:16.590 --> 31:18.240
until the incense burns out,

31:20.820 --> 31:22.220
I'll believe

31:22.750 --> 31:24.550
you're useful.

31:27.440 --> 31:28.880
However,

31:29.770 --> 31:31.490
it won't be easy.

31:32.550 --> 31:34.310
After all,

31:34.890 --> 31:37.130
I personally made this incense.

32:48.030 --> 32:48.750
Sir!

32:49.920 --> 32:52.600
Sir, where are you going?

32:52.720 --> 32:53.770
I'm going to Baiyu Village.

32:53.770 --> 32:56.160
There are some things I haven't figured out yet.

32:56.160 --> 32:58.400
Bai... Baiyu Village?

32:59.880 --> 33:02.010
I know you're afraid of Baiyu Village.

33:02.440 --> 33:03.590
But please don't worry.

33:03.590 --> 33:05.190
I'm just going to take a look.

33:07.240 --> 33:09.300
And thank you for treating my wounds.

33:09.450 --> 33:10.270
Take care.

33:26.240 --> 33:29.100
This dummy really doesn't know what's good for him.

33:49.860 --> 33:52.030
Ye Yuan is going out of the city?

33:52.670 --> 33:54.310
We must not alert him.
